    "title": "'Black Phone 2' falls victim to sequel fatigue - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Shohini Mitra ,\n9 hours ago \"Black Phone 2\" premiered on Friday and once again proved that sequels rarely measure up to the original. \"The Black Phone\" follows the story of a small town with a kidnapper on the loose. The Grabber (Ethan Hawke), infamous throughout the quaint Denver suburbs, is known for grabbing and eventually killing young boys. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
